Upstream-Name: cdie
Upstream-Contact: hors <horsicq@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/horsicq/Detect-It-Easy
Comment:
 cdie is linked statically from the cdie, xxfclib, xxwidgets, xxnetlib,
 xxgithub and cdisasm sources, all by the same author under the MIT license.
 cdisasm also carries instruction tables generated from third-party data
 (Intel XED, LLVM and others); their notices and license texts are installed
 in /usr/share/doc/cdie/licenses/cdisasm/. The bundled signature database
 (/usr/lib/cdie/db, db_custom) comes from Detect It Easy.

